WEBVTT

00:00:05.170 --> 00:00:07.190
Cou-sama, are you awake?

00:00:07.730 --> 00:00:12.640
I am... but it's not time to get up!

00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:13.490
Yeah.

00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:16.790
Today's the last day of Union Fest.

00:00:16.790 --> 00:00:20.210
The town will be quite 
lively again, I'm sure.

00:00:20.210 --> 00:00:23.230
Yeah, I bet it'll be quite a party.

00:00:23.230 --> 00:00:26.610
I'm sad that the festivities are ending.

00:00:26.610 --> 00:00:30.560
I wish the fun times would 
just continue forever!

00:00:33.020 --> 00:00:34.430
Me, too...

00:02:11.360 --> 00:02:14.320
The three Heroes' return home is scheduled

00:02:14.320 --> 00:02:17.320
for two days after the end of Union Fest.

00:02:18.090 --> 00:02:22.320
The day on which we have to 
part is already looming...

00:02:24.160 --> 00:02:28.560
We're really grateful that 
you're taking us, Rebecca.

00:02:25.830 --> 00:02:31.830
Final Stage

00:02:28.560 --> 00:02:30.510
Thank you!

00:02:30.510 --> 00:02:31.830
Don't mention it.

00:02:32.010 --> 00:02:35.800
So today, Nanami's going to 
Biscotti with the Princess.

00:02:36.060 --> 00:02:38.290
Sink's going to Pastillage with Couverte.

00:02:38.290 --> 00:02:40.090
And I'm going to Galette.

00:02:40.470 --> 00:02:44.480
It's kind of like a Hero trade.

00:02:44.480 --> 00:02:45.600
Indeed.

00:02:45.930 --> 00:02:49.100
We've prepared something pretty fun.

00:02:49.360 --> 00:02:52.600
Nanami and Millihi have 
given their consent, but...

00:02:56.130 --> 00:02:58.110
Rebecca, won't you play along, too?

00:03:02.610 --> 00:03:06.620
Now, broadcast live, 
the Union Fest special!

00:03:07.230 --> 00:03:09.330
Our guest at the studio

00:03:09.330 --> 00:03:11.950
is the ruler of the Republic of Biscotti,

00:03:11.950 --> 00:03:13.880
Princess Millihiore!

00:03:14.240 --> 00:03:15.500
Hello.

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:17.560
Representing the Galette Lion Army,

00:03:17.560 --> 00:03:19.260
we have the ladies from Genoise!

00:03:19.260 --> 00:03:20.510
Yeah!

00:03:20.510 --> 00:03:23.270
And right here, we have Biscotti's...

00:03:24.300 --> 00:03:25.700
Hiya!

00:03:26.370 --> 00:03:29.890
I'm Biscotti's hero, Takatsuki Nanami!

00:03:29.890 --> 00:03:31.140
What?!

00:03:31.140 --> 00:03:36.070
Um, this hero seems to be a 
little different than usual...

00:03:36.070 --> 00:03:37.600
Oh, really?

00:03:37.600 --> 00:03:39.480
I am the hero!

00:03:40.840 --> 00:03:43.240
Actually, we have a little project going

00:03:43.240 --> 00:03:46.360
and Nanami-san is my Hero for today.

00:03:46.360 --> 00:03:48.660
A "One Day Hero", so to speak.

00:03:51.850 --> 00:03:53.220
Lady Leo!

00:03:53.220 --> 00:03:55.290
Today's the final day of the Union Fest.

00:03:55.290 --> 00:03:57.040
How do you feel about the event so far?

00:03:57.600 --> 00:04:00.730
So far I have nothing to complain about.  It's been perfect.

00:04:00.730 --> 00:04:03.480
Prince Gaul, a word about the Hero?

00:04:03.480 --> 00:04:05.660
Why not use this opportunity 
to talk to her directly?

00:04:07.150 --> 00:04:09.690
Then come, my Hero!

00:04:09.690 --> 00:04:10.430
Yes!

00:04:12.370 --> 00:04:13.940
H-Hello.

00:04:13.940 --> 00:04:16.820
I'm Galette's hero, Rebecca.

00:04:17.830 --> 00:04:20.180
Today Rebecca is Galette's Hero.

00:04:20.630 --> 00:04:23.610
Well, the Ex Machina is a replica.

00:04:23.610 --> 00:04:25.700
But her cuteness is quite real!

00:04:26.810 --> 00:04:28.760
Thank you.

00:04:28.760 --> 00:04:31.700
Rebecca-sama is really cute.

00:04:32.070 --> 00:04:33.990
Nanami-dono and Rebecca-dono

00:04:33.990 --> 00:04:35.210
do look good in those outfits.

00:04:35.820 --> 00:04:38.060
That means our Hero

00:04:38.060 --> 00:04:42.520
is Pastillage's Hero for the day, right?

00:04:42.520 --> 00:04:43.720
Indeed.

00:04:43.720 --> 00:04:47.610
That means that he'll have 
to wear the costume, right?

00:04:48.100 --> 00:04:50.130
Indeed...

00:04:51.810 --> 00:04:54.840
<i>Magical Beam!</i>

00:04:55.980 --> 00:04:57.630
That's not good!

00:04:57.630 --> 00:04:59.660
No, actually it's not bad.

00:04:59.660 --> 00:05:00.840
Indeed.

00:05:00.840 --> 00:05:02.990
It's borderline in many respects!

00:05:03.770 --> 00:05:04.830
Sorry for the wait.

00:05:11.930 --> 00:05:13.990
Huh? What's wrong?

00:05:13.990 --> 00:05:16.950
Oh, that suits you quite well.

00:05:16.950 --> 00:05:19.570
I'm glad... really glad...

00:05:19.570 --> 00:05:20.900
If you think about it,

00:05:20.900 --> 00:05:22.940
this was the only thing that makes sense.

00:05:22.940 --> 00:05:25.590
You look good, Sink!

00:05:26.060 --> 00:05:27.920
Huh? Thanks...

00:05:29.110 --> 00:05:34.010
I guess the Heroes are all 
going to go home soon.

00:05:34.010 --> 00:05:36.850
Well, I heard they're 
coming back very soon.

00:05:36.850 --> 00:05:39.610
Earth, that brings back memories...

00:05:39.610 --> 00:05:44.110
Couldn't I go with them 
while they're over there?

00:05:44.110 --> 00:05:45.960
Why do you want to go?

00:05:45.960 --> 00:05:47.110
Isn't that obvious?

00:05:47.750 --> 00:05:49.810
To check out the body types and

00:05:49.810 --> 00:05:51.950
underwear of the girls over there.

00:05:53.010 --> 00:05:56.350
I couldn't quite hear you. 
What did you say?

00:05:56.350 --> 00:05:57.960
Nothing.

00:05:57.960 --> 00:06:00.220
I thought so.

00:06:01.070 --> 00:06:05.710
That's that, so please enjoy 
tonight's Final Stage!

00:06:05.710 --> 00:06:08.420
Everybody, great work!

00:06:08.420 --> 00:06:09.470
Yup.

00:06:09.470 --> 00:06:11.350
Great work!

00:06:12.100 --> 00:06:13.980
Huh? Noir?

00:06:13.980 --> 00:06:16.980
Rico, Noir, and I are going out for a bit.

00:06:17.550 --> 00:06:19.150
Should I bring you somewhere?

00:06:19.150 --> 00:06:21.010
No, we're fine.

00:06:21.010 --> 00:06:23.730
The Skyer can handle us three just fine.

00:06:24.680 --> 00:06:28.710
All right. We'll be back before 
Millihi-nee's live performance.

00:06:28.710 --> 00:06:29.740
Be careful.

00:06:30.180 --> 00:06:32.200
Skyer, go!

00:06:32.200 --> 00:06:34.120
Bye bye!

00:06:34.870 --> 00:06:37.890
Okay, should we go to the stage, too?

00:06:37.890 --> 00:06:38.550
Yeah.

00:06:38.550 --> 00:06:40.120
Agreed.

00:06:41.240 --> 00:06:44.130
Biometric data confirmed for 
the rightful heir to Pastillage

00:06:44.610 --> 00:06:47.450
and the Heavenly Spear Crimaris is present.

00:06:49.860 --> 00:06:51.210
Opening doors.

00:06:55.280 --> 00:06:57.520
This is the legendary treasure vault

00:06:57.520 --> 00:06:59.430
under Castle Eschenbach,

00:06:59.430 --> 00:07:01.990
the pride of Pastillage that's both

00:07:01.990 --> 00:07:04.150
an ancient place and a giant maze.

00:07:04.470 --> 00:07:06.470
I have heard stories,

00:07:06.470 --> 00:07:09.150
but this is the first time 
I've ever been inside!

00:07:09.580 --> 00:07:11.380
You both mentioned before that you

00:07:11.380 --> 00:07:13.280
wanted to explore this place.

00:07:13.750 --> 00:07:16.610
That was when we were quite young.

00:07:16.610 --> 00:07:19.200
You remembered?!

00:07:19.490 --> 00:07:24.040
It's my motto to never 
forget or break promises,

00:07:24.040 --> 00:07:26.300
but you'll have to be careful.

00:07:26.700 --> 00:07:30.910
This vault is filled with 
traps to catch intruders.

00:07:33.290 --> 00:07:36.330
But those are only on lower floors.

00:07:36.330 --> 00:07:39.560
The ones on the first 
floor are all deactivated.

00:07:39.770 --> 00:07:41.760
Oh, Cou-sama!

00:07:41.760 --> 00:07:43.920
Don't scare me like that!

00:07:44.370 --> 00:07:47.820
But you have some business 
down here as well, right?

00:07:47.820 --> 00:07:50.200
Yes. I wanted to fetch an item

00:07:50.200 --> 00:07:53.490
that I wanted to give Rebecca 
for the return ritual.

00:07:53.490 --> 00:07:57.200
I've stored some mementos down here.

00:07:57.200 --> 00:07:58.580
I see.

00:07:58.580 --> 00:08:00.450
And Rico, Noir,

00:08:00.450 --> 00:08:04.790
you both have experienced 
the return ritual.

00:08:04.790 --> 00:08:08.030
I wanted to ask you to tell 
me a little about that.

00:08:08.980 --> 00:08:10.590
Oh, there it is!

00:08:11.000 --> 00:08:12.680
That jewel case.

00:08:20.020 --> 00:08:22.540
Let's take this first and....

00:08:30.130 --> 00:08:31.450
Cou-sama!

00:08:31.450 --> 00:08:33.070
Skyer!

00:08:33.070 --> 00:08:34.790
Bright Power Release!

00:08:34.790 --> 00:08:35.660
Seven Tails!

00:08:44.930 --> 00:08:46.850
Just in time...

00:08:46.850 --> 00:08:49.540
Nicely done, Noir!

00:08:50.010 --> 00:08:51.960
You saved us.

00:08:52.450 --> 00:08:54.260
That trap was active.

00:08:54.260 --> 00:08:56.970
Well, this place is quite old,

00:08:56.970 --> 00:09:00.220
so it's bound to have some issues...

00:09:00.220 --> 00:09:02.130
Where are we?

00:09:02.130 --> 00:09:04.970
I guess about ten levels lower.

00:09:04.970 --> 00:09:06.940
We only fell straight down.

00:09:06.940 --> 00:09:09.010
If I use Skyer, it's easy to...

00:09:12.100 --> 00:09:13.910
It closed.

00:09:13.910 --> 00:09:15.420
That means...

00:09:16.110 --> 00:09:18.370
We're trapped!

00:09:19.780 --> 00:09:21.700
There's a map!

00:09:23.420 --> 00:09:26.710
If we check that, I'm sure 
we'll find the way out!

00:09:38.220 --> 00:09:39.700
A trap...

00:09:41.780 --> 00:09:46.350
You two, be careful where you step.

00:09:53.060 --> 00:09:56.200
Sorry, I should've kept my mouth shut.

00:10:05.150 --> 00:10:07.440
This maze is horrible.

00:10:07.440 --> 00:10:09.870
We have to get out of here.

00:10:11.030 --> 00:10:13.310
This chair is perfect.

00:10:13.990 --> 00:10:15.400
This sound...

00:10:16.080 --> 00:10:17.300
Could it be...

00:10:17.300 --> 00:10:19.550
Could it be...

00:10:23.310 --> 00:10:25.450
I knew it!

00:10:34.230 --> 00:10:36.610
Rebecca, is something wrong?

00:10:37.570 --> 00:10:39.530
No, it's nothing.

00:10:40.200 --> 00:10:41.370
Really?

00:10:41.370 --> 00:10:42.510
Yes.

00:10:45.120 --> 00:10:49.120
<i>I wonder why I have this 
really bad feeling...</i>

00:10:50.790 --> 00:10:53.750
A side path! We need a side path!

00:10:53.750 --> 00:10:56.380
There are no intersections in sight,
 no matter how far we run!

00:10:57.400 --> 00:10:59.400
It's catching up to us!

00:11:10.140 --> 00:11:11.670
Are you all okay?

00:11:11.670 --> 00:11:13.620
I'm alive...

00:11:18.370 --> 00:11:20.490
Is that Becky?

00:11:20.490 --> 00:11:22.180
Hey, Sink,

00:11:22.180 --> 00:11:24.490
did Cou-sama and the 
others get there already?

00:11:24.490 --> 00:11:26.240
Not yet...

00:11:26.730 --> 00:11:27.960
That's weird.

00:11:27.960 --> 00:11:31.410
It shouldn't take that long...

00:11:31.410 --> 00:11:32.750
What?

00:11:33.400 --> 00:11:34.970
Under the castle?

00:11:34.970 --> 00:11:38.410
Yes, she was going to the 
treasure vault under the castle.

00:11:39.060 --> 00:11:41.010
Treasure vault?

00:11:41.370 --> 00:11:43.550
That's the maze I used when

00:11:43.550 --> 00:11:45.760
I was still doing my Demon King thing.

00:11:46.240 --> 00:11:48.780
It's a dark and intense final dungeon

00:11:48.780 --> 00:11:50.980
that's filled with brutal traps.

00:11:50.980 --> 00:11:51.770
What?!

00:11:51.770 --> 00:11:55.050
Of course the traps are all deactivated.

00:11:55.050 --> 00:11:58.280
But that place is really old, so...

00:11:58.870 --> 00:11:59.610
Becky!

00:11:59.610 --> 00:12:00.860
Yes!

00:12:05.960 --> 00:12:08.370
Is this a dead end?

00:12:10.430 --> 00:12:13.730
Let's take a breather, I'm a bit tired.

00:12:13.730 --> 00:12:15.840
I agree.

00:12:15.840 --> 00:12:18.920
Rico, Noir, I'm really sorry.

00:12:19.320 --> 00:12:22.450
This happened because I invited you here.

00:12:22.450 --> 00:12:25.330
Cou-sama, that's not true.

00:12:25.330 --> 00:12:28.890
We're the ones who wanted 
to come here, anyway.

00:12:29.330 --> 00:12:32.630
But if I had been more careful,

00:12:33.260 --> 00:12:35.690
if I had properly maintained this place...

00:12:35.690 --> 00:12:38.560
Well, then I could have also

00:12:38.560 --> 00:12:42.180
caught you two with my Seven 
Tails before you fell.

00:12:42.180 --> 00:12:45.950
And I should have noticed 
the trap on the floor.

00:12:45.950 --> 00:12:47.200
But...

00:12:47.370 --> 00:12:48.950
We're fine.

00:12:48.950 --> 00:12:50.770
We're below the castle,

00:12:50.770 --> 00:12:52.960
so someone's bound to come save us soon.

00:12:53.290 --> 00:12:54.740
Right!

00:12:54.740 --> 00:12:56.710
Anyway, let's take a rest.

00:12:57.500 --> 00:12:59.330
Oh that reminds me, Cou-sama.

00:12:59.330 --> 00:13:03.220
What did you want to know 
about the return ritual?

00:13:03.220 --> 00:13:06.720
Oh, yes... Did you feel sad when

00:13:06.720 --> 00:13:09.220
you had to say good bye to your Hero?

00:13:09.220 --> 00:13:12.220
Or... did you maybe feel worried...

00:13:12.220 --> 00:13:13.930
and stuff like that...

00:13:13.930 --> 00:13:17.190
Of course I felt sad and lonely,

00:13:17.190 --> 00:13:19.400
and I cried and cried.

00:13:19.400 --> 00:13:23.050
The last return was 
difficult on many levels.

00:13:23.050 --> 00:13:24.410
I heard a bit about that.

00:13:24.410 --> 00:13:28.540
But when I heard that we would meet again,

00:13:28.540 --> 00:13:30.770
all my lonely feelings just flew away!

00:13:31.310 --> 00:13:35.370
I'm also sad that Nanami 
and Sink are leaving,

00:13:35.940 --> 00:13:38.630
but we really can meet 
again whenever we want.

00:13:39.770 --> 00:13:43.880
Even knowing that, I'm still worried.

00:13:44.500 --> 00:13:47.640
Rebecca lives in a far away world.

00:13:47.640 --> 00:13:50.760
There are many fun things 
in her home world,

00:13:50.760 --> 00:13:53.610
a lot of people who are important to her...

00:13:53.610 --> 00:13:58.450
I worry that she'll forget 
about me after a while.

00:13:59.280 --> 00:14:00.690
Cou-sama...

00:14:00.690 --> 00:14:04.370
I know. Rebecca is a kind girl.

00:14:04.370 --> 00:14:06.820
I know that won't happen.

00:14:07.220 --> 00:14:08.990
But I still feel really sad about

00:14:08.990 --> 00:14:11.010
having to part with her.

00:14:11.610 --> 00:14:13.790
I don't have enough faith...

00:14:14.640 --> 00:14:18.680
Just laugh at me for being 
a feeble fledgling ruler.

00:14:19.120 --> 00:14:21.150
We'd never laugh at you.

00:14:25.020 --> 00:14:26.150
There's nobody in the world

00:14:26.150 --> 00:14:28.620
who wouldn't feel sad

00:14:28.620 --> 00:14:31.050
when they have to part 
with someone they love.

00:14:32.610 --> 00:14:35.840
Okay, Rico. The break's over.

00:14:35.840 --> 00:14:37.280
Right!

00:14:37.280 --> 00:14:39.530
We need to make sure that you

00:14:39.530 --> 00:14:40.910
can spend as much time as possible

00:14:40.910 --> 00:14:43.190
with Rebecca before she has to leave!

00:14:43.190 --> 00:14:45.360
So we're getting out of here.

00:14:45.360 --> 00:14:47.570
Rico... Noir...

00:14:50.720 --> 00:14:51.520
Now...

00:14:53.830 --> 00:14:57.580
That's not fair! 
Just when I was being cool!

00:14:57.940 --> 00:14:59.340
First, we have to esc-

00:15:02.040 --> 00:15:03.250
We can't...

00:15:04.920 --> 00:15:06.210
You two, up there!

00:15:17.900 --> 00:15:19.700
I am going to do something about this.

00:15:19.700 --> 00:15:23.600
I am not going to let my 
best friends get hurt!

00:15:33.480 --> 00:15:35.580
I've located the Crimaris.

00:15:36.170 --> 00:15:38.160
The trap's been temporarily stopped,

00:15:38.160 --> 00:15:39.830
but it won't last long.

00:15:39.830 --> 00:15:42.300
Sink, Rebecca, please get them out!

00:15:42.300 --> 00:15:43.330
Right!

00:15:43.570 --> 00:15:46.250
Hey, take this!

00:15:47.620 --> 00:15:48.730
What is this?

00:15:48.730 --> 00:15:50.120
A Demon God Crystal.

00:15:50.120 --> 00:15:51.590
Simply put, it's the Demon King's version

00:15:51.590 --> 00:15:53.120
of the Hero Crystal.

00:15:53.120 --> 00:15:55.970
I'm sure you'll be able to use it well.

00:15:57.480 --> 00:15:58.810
I'll do my best!

00:16:00.400 --> 00:16:02.220
Hero Teleport!

00:16:05.980 --> 00:16:08.230
It's falling again!

00:16:10.230 --> 00:16:12.310
If only I could open this door...

00:16:30.830 --> 00:16:32.260
Sorry for the wait, guys!

00:16:32.720 --> 00:16:34.760
Hero "Just in Time" Sink...

00:16:34.760 --> 00:16:37.260
...and Hero Rebecca have arrived!

00:16:37.650 --> 00:16:39.770
Sink... Rebecca...

00:16:39.940 --> 00:16:41.770
Hang on, we're going to

00:16:41.770 --> 00:16:43.700
push this thing back right now!

00:16:45.060 --> 00:16:47.690
What the... this thing is really heavy.

00:16:48.660 --> 00:16:50.030
I'll do it.

00:16:50.030 --> 00:16:54.030
Sink, can I ask you to 
hold it for just a moment?

00:16:54.510 --> 00:16:55.520
Got it!

00:16:57.530 --> 00:17:00.290
Demon God Crystal, activate!

00:17:05.970 --> 00:17:07.290
Demon King Seal!

00:17:15.950 --> 00:17:19.050
Witch Cannon! Ultra Demon King Mode!

00:17:22.140 --> 00:17:24.310
Everybody, get down!

00:17:24.610 --> 00:17:27.210
Go!

00:18:10.820 --> 00:18:14.230
Thanks Sink.  I managed somehow.

00:18:26.410 --> 00:18:28.090
Hero!

00:18:27.170 --> 00:18:28.710
Sink!

00:18:30.060 --> 00:18:31.250
Rebecca!

00:18:31.610 --> 00:18:32.800
Cou-sama!

00:18:32.800 --> 00:18:39.300
Rebecca... I'm so happy...

00:18:39.760 --> 00:18:41.980
Jeez. I told you that you have

00:18:41.980 --> 00:18:44.380
to always take me or the knights

00:18:44.380 --> 00:18:46.810
when you go somewhere dangerous.

00:18:48.840 --> 00:18:51.210
I'm so sorry.

00:18:51.210 --> 00:18:53.960
But I'm really relieved that you're safe.

00:18:53.960 --> 00:18:56.600
I am a knight...

00:18:56.600 --> 00:18:59.320
Noir, shhh.

00:18:59.320 --> 00:19:01.850
Now let's get out of here.

00:19:01.850 --> 00:19:04.080
The Princess's performance is starting soon!

00:19:05.300 --> 00:19:06.750
You're right!

00:19:08.540 --> 00:19:10.170
We're on schedule for the show.

00:19:10.820 --> 00:19:11.750
Five minutes!

00:19:12.650 --> 00:19:13.630
Princess!

00:19:14.110 --> 00:19:16.880
Everybody just now got to their seats!

00:19:17.450 --> 00:19:19.020
That's great...

00:19:19.490 --> 00:19:23.140
Oh, but are they all okay? Is anybody hurt?

00:19:23.140 --> 00:19:24.320
All is well.

00:19:24.320 --> 00:19:26.670
They're all laughing and smiling.

00:19:26.670 --> 00:19:28.390
Then I'm relieved.

00:19:28.390 --> 00:19:31.030
I'm going to my seat, as well.

00:19:31.030 --> 00:19:33.150
Princess, good luck!

00:19:33.640 --> 00:19:34.630
Thank you!

00:19:35.350 --> 00:19:37.970
Princess!  Princess!

00:19:45.180 --> 00:19:48.590
My dreams will come true, I'm sure of it.

00:19:48.590 --> 00:19:52.660
My wishes are overflowing.

00:19:52.660 --> 00:20:00.730
I will catch them now, in the light.

00:20:14.480 --> 00:20:21.150
I want to show them, tell them 
to you, these important feelings!

00:20:21.150 --> 00:20:27.890
These feelings of love 
tucked away in my heart...

00:20:28.290 --> 00:20:35.810
Right now, a summer-colored 
flower opens in the blue wind.

00:20:36.480 --> 00:20:41.970
The chance for love is right here.

00:20:42.490 --> 00:20:48.390
My heart waves when I think you may not love me too.

00:20:48.390 --> 00:20:57.860
But it's okay, I'll just start walking 
and move forward step by step.

00:20:57.860 --> 00:21:01.100
My dreams will come true, I'm sure of it.

00:21:01.100 --> 00:21:05.270
My wishes are overflowing.

00:21:05.270 --> 00:21:11.510
If you can share smiles, 
that's the beginning.

00:21:11.510 --> 00:21:14.870
I'm sure your love will blossom.

00:21:14.870 --> 00:21:23.120
I'm so excited that my heart 
is pounding when we touch.

00:21:23.120 --> 00:21:29.560
My heart sparkles in the light.

00:21:29.560 --> 00:21:36.480
Listen to the season of love,

00:21:36.480 --> 00:21:47.700
and don't forget to smile.

00:23:30.890 --> 00:23:32.950
The costume for Pastillage's 
One Day Hero...

00:23:32.950 --> 00:23:34.050
Wait, this is Becky's!

00:23:34.050 --> 00:23:36.210
Once again, I'm grateful to everybody.

00:23:36.210 --> 00:23:39.550
This elasticity is quite something.
